  "annihilator": {
    "proved": true,
    "theorem": "For every centrally symmetric Max+ of a conference matrix, the Schur square P\u2299P of the design projector P=YY\u1d40/(2N) annihilates range(P). Proof: range(P)=colspace(Y); for z=Yv one has (P\u2299P z)_a \u221d \u2211_b (y_a\u00b7y_b)\u00b2 (y_b\u00b7v); the coefficient of each ambient coordinate is N \u2211_{jk} y_{aj} y_{ak} E[y_j y_k y_i]=0 because all third moments vanish by Max+=\u2212Max+.",
    "corollary_sum_P3": "\u2211_{a,b} P_ab\u00b3 = Tr((P\u2299P)P) = 0"
  },
  "gap_criterion": {
